I have been a member of this community for over 20 years and have seen many changes since then. The last few months have been particularly difficult as we have had several incidents involving members of our community who are not part of the group. These incidents have included:

A man was shot by another member of the group after he refused to leave his car;

An individual was stabbed multiple times while attempting to break into an apartment complex;

Two individuals were arrested on suspicion of assault with a deadly weapon;

A woman was assaulted at her home;

A man was beaten up outside of a bar;

A man was attacked by two men who yelled racial slurs at him;

